It is given that \(n=100\)
So, \(76+x+y=100\), i.e., \(x+y=24\)

The median is 525 , which lies in the class \(500-600\)
So, \(\quad l=500, \quad f=20, \quad \mathrm{cf}=36+x, \quad h=100\)

Using the formula :
\[\begin{aligned}
